{"unit_id":"ant404__dsh-media-gen#card-zh","repo":"ant404/dsh-media-gen","commit":"49908df64cb42e7ddeda62fcd27af4bdecd9c73f","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-media-gen 是面向 DSH web 会话的媒体生成插件。它在 DSH 会话中注册媒体工具，并提供独立的「媒体生成」设置页，让用户选择图像生成、图像编辑和视频生成各自使用的 Provider 与模型。主要功能包括按文字生成图片、依据本地图片或网络图片进行编辑、按文字或参考图片生成视频、把生成文件保存到当前工作区 media_gen 并在聊天中展示。适合希望在 DSH 对话里制作图片或视频，并复用 DSH 模型配置的用户。使用前需先配置兼容的模型 Provider、API 凭据和对应媒体模型。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1353-1444","client.js:925-950","index.js:764-771"]}
{"unit_id":"ant404__dsh-media-gen#card-en","repo":"ant404/dsh-media-gen","commit":"49908df64cb42e7ddeda62fcd27af4bdecd9c73f","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-media-gen adds image generation, image editing, and video creation to DSH chat. Choose a compatible provider and model for each task in its settings page. Files are saved in the workspace media_gen folder and can be shown in chat. Configure a provider and media models in DSH Model settings.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1353-1444","client.js:925-950","index.js:764-771"]}
