{"unit_id":"ant404__dsh-media-gen#feature-1","repo":"ant404/dsh-media-gen","commit":"49908df64cb42e7ddeda62fcd27af4bdecd9c73f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-media-gen 的功能「图片生成」：通过会话工具提交文字提示和可选尺寸，使用设置中选定的文生图模型生成图片，保存到当前工作区 media_gen 并返回聊天可展示的图片行。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1368-1390"]}
